  "design": {
    "idea": "Joust 2 against silk-swinging Dame Spindle on the court_v1-mutated floor: bolt her glowing corner anchor spool to unhorse her mid-swing, open the Cycle 1 juror shortcut back to court_r1, and choose Verdict 2 for the Arbiter.",
